---
source: tui/src/bottom_pane/list_selection_view.rs
expression: "render_lines_with_width(&view, 90)"
---
                                                                                          
  Configuration                                                                           
  Toggle TUI settings (changes saved to config.toml)                                      
                                                                                          
› 1. Pinned Plan Drawer (off)                Pin plan updates to a drawer in the          
                                             viewport instead of history                  
  2. Resize Reflow (on) (current)            Reflow transcript history when the terminal  
                                             width changes                                
  3. Custom Working Messages (on) (current)  Rotate playful status messages while the     
                                             agent is working                             
  4. Vertical Footer (off)                   Stack footer segments vertically instead     
                                             of horizontally                              
  5. Terminal Notifications (on) (current)   Send OSC 9 escape sequences to notify the    
                                             terminal on events                           
  6. OS Notifications (on) (current)         Send native desktop notifications on events  
  7. Vim Mode (off)                          Enable vim-style navigation in the textarea  
                                             (Escape enters normal mode)                  
  8. Auto Worktree (off)                     Create a git worktree at session start       
                                                                                          
  ↑/k ↓/j navigate, f, /, ctrl+f search, enter confirm, esc go back
